Iridium 1.0.36 - Client Bot Inline Navigation

🔄 Complete UX overhaul:
- All navigation via inline buttons
- Single message editing (no reply keyboards)
- Clean menu flow with back buttons

📱 New structure:
- Main menu → Buy / Profile / Promo / Support
- Each section edits same message
- Promo input via text (auto-deletes)

✨ Improvements:
- QR code sends as photo
- FAQ section with setup instructions
- Consistent back navigation everywhere
